cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ANKUSI Wheel Fitment Dataset
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below and keep a
  visible link back to the canonical page, as required by CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: ANKUSI Wheels Engineering Team
    website: 'https://ankusiwheels.com/'
    city: Guangzhou
    country: CN
abstract: >-
  Open, machine-readable factory wheel specifications for 7,583 vehicle variants
  across 130 makes and 46 bolt patterns, model years 1940 to 2027. Fields include
  bolt pattern, centre bore in millimetres (front and, where different, rear),
  lug count, OE wheel size and offset, plus commonly referenced flush and maximum
  aftermarket sizes. Compiled from published OEM specifications and cross-checked
  against independent fitment references; records where sources disagree are
  withheld rather than guessed. Corrections are logged in the README.
keywords:
  - wheel fitment
  - bolt pattern
  - PCD
  - centre bore
  - wheel offset
  - automotive
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: 'https://ankusiwheels.com/wheel-fitment-dataset/'
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.6084/m9.figshare.33921994
version: 2026.09.19b
date-released: '2026-09-19'
